                              "name": "In uncontrolled mode (no onReorder), updates to the items prop —",
                              "fill": "$accordion-docs-muted-text",
                              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                              "width": "fill_container",
                              "content": "In uncontrolled mode (no onReorder), updates to the items prop — loading flags, content, errors set by the parent after mount — were silently ignored; the internal snapshot from first render was kept forever. The component now adopts a changed items prop (internal reorder state still wins between renders).",
