                              "name": "The trigger's rounded-b-none-when-open rule used an ancestor sel",
                              "fill": "$accordion-docs-muted-text",
                              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                              "width": "fill_container",
                              "content": "The trigger's rounded-b-none-when-open rule used an ancestor selector [[data-panel-open]_&], but Base UI sets data-panel-open on the trigger itself — the rule never matched, so bottom corners stayed rounded on open panels. Now uses the self-variant data-panel-open:rounded-b-none; verified in-browser (0px radius when open, 7.2px when closed).",
                              "lineHeight": 1.4615384615384615,
                              "fontFamily": "Geist",
                              "fontSize": 13,
                              "fontWeight": "normal"
                            }
                          ]
                        },
