                              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                              "width": "fill_container",
                              "content": "renderAccordionItem (the non-draggable item renderer) called the useItemOpenHandler hook once per item, changing hook count as the search filter changed the item list. Replaced with a hook-free makeItemOpenHandler factory; react-hooks/rules-of-hooks now passes. React 19 + React Compiler masked the crash at runtime; uncompiled builds would have failed.",
                              "lineHeight": 1.4615384615384615,
                              "fontFamily": "Geist",
