                              "fill": "$accordion-docs-muted-text",
                              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                              "width": "fill_container",
                              "content": "Base UI 1.9's Accordion.Item does not call the consumer's onOpenChange, so Kira's onItemOpen, onItemClose and everything built on them (asyncLoading flows, per-item callbacks) never ran. Kira now observes the item's data-open attribute and fires the callbacks on transitions. Found during the full-pass QA — the asyncLoading demo worked before only by accident of its initial state.",
